OL,3,GNEWSAWarning issued as love locks
OL,4,Areappear on bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities have renewed warnings over
OL,7,Flove locks after padlocks began
OL,8,Freappearing on a bridge in Nottingham.
OL,10,FHundreds of commemorative padlocks were
OL,11,Ftaken off the Wilford Suspension Bridge
OL,12,Fin October due to structural concerns.
OL,14,FSevern Trent, which owns the
OL,15,Ffootbridge, said the weight of the
OL,16,Flocks was impacting its structural
OL,17,Fintegrity but promised a new space for
OL,18,Flocks to be placed along the Victoria
OL,19,FEmbankment.
